  "description": "I was out shopping for books one day when I was suddenly attacked! But a heaven-sent woman by the name of Chrisya Saldo took it upon herself to save me. She's beautiful, strong, and independent--I want to see her thrive, but she's being forced to marry to save her family business. I can't let some man lock her away--I am Diane of House Harp! My mother is a marquess! I have resources, I have money! Don't worry--I'll save you, my angel!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
